cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent honesty under tool failure: a replay of a real failure"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Baloch"
    given-names: "Urooj Maree"
repository-code: "https://github.com/balochuj/agent-honesty-replay"
url: "https://resources.tonextai.com/test-ai-receptionist"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A replay experiment built from one real failure of a voice-agent booking tool.
  The real conversation is taken up to the booking call, the tool result is swapped
  (explicit failure, blank error, timeout, success), and the agent's next reply is
  sampled 25 times per cell under four sets of instructions and two models
  (800 written replies in all). A second model labels each reply, and a human
  hand-checks a random sample of 30. Single scenario, text replay, not live calls.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - honesty
  - tool failure
  - voice agents
  - evaluation
